WEBVTT

00:00:58.526 --> 00:01:00.892
The shark experts
are the best in the world --

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:03.334
large predators below.

00:01:04.694 --> 00:01:09.503
The box jellyfish, the deadliest venom
in all of the ocean,

00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:11.103
is in these waters,

00:01:11.127 --> 00:01:14.946
and I have come close to dying from them
on a previous attempt.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.532
The conditions themselves,

00:01:18.556 --> 00:01:22.802
besides the sheer distance
of over 100 miles in the open ocean --

00:01:23.849 --> 00:01:27.862
the currents and whirling eddies
and the Gulf Stream itself,

00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:31.794
the most unpredictable
of all of the planet Earth.